      "content": "I'm not so sure. Most of the recent papers in this symposium have used much larger cohorts to justify these kinds of claims. If a reviewer sees $n=12$ and then sees us claiming \"high precision,\" won't they see right through that? Are we sure we shouldn't just be more upfront about it being a pilot study or a limitation?",
